    "detailed_description": "<h1>About us</h1><p>The game is currently developed by two people, one programmer and one designer. So please expect the shortage of game art. The game is currently in development, but we hope to see you as soon as possible!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/e406cdaebf7d6b041536742aa769bb39.avif?t=1745569229\" /></div><br><br>Project Blemmyes is a sci-fi themed roguelite game that combines battle armor, free movement, data simulation and AI mechanical elements.<br><br>In the not-too-distant future, a company researching AI technology is conducting an experiment to attempt to store human consciousness in a USB flash drive. As the player you\u2019ve been forced to participate in this bizarre experiment, and through battles... and deaths... are trying to make your escape.<br><br>In this third-person shooter, you'll face many different choices: choose your character, build on skills obtained in battle and exploration, plan your journey, and choose your weapons... Choose carefully though, because your fate is in your hands!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/5ca30cb050aa7f48b5f4889b0fd59452.poster.avif?t=1745569229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/5ca30cb050aa7f48b5f4889b0fd59452.webm?t=1745569229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/5ca30cb050aa7f48b5f4889b0fd59452.mp4?t=1745569229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/b73ca627fdc5c2ee21e55b0b334dbb80.avif?t=1745569229\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomly generated levels - every battle is a brand new adventure<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/fecf313c033a7f79be972799d23b6483.poster.avif?t=1745569229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/fecf313c033a7f79be972799d23b6483.webm?t=1745569229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/fecf313c033a7f79be972799d23b6483.mp4?t=1745569229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Wide range of weapons - choose the best weapons to deal with different scenarios<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/2e66cb626b084a7e8d7355db90f39e9a.poster.avif?t=1745569229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/2e66cb626b084a7e8d7355db90f39e9a.webm?t=1745569229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/2e66cb626b084a7e8d7355db90f39e9a.mp4?t=1745569229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/38b443182d79e1d4d3cfa62670f34066.poster.avif?t=1745569229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/38b443182d79e1d4d3cfa62670f34066.webm?t=1745569229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754500/extras/38b443182d79e1d4d3cfa62670f34066.mp4?t=1745569229\" type=\"video/mp4\">